[gd_scene format=3]

; A host's call moves the current Camera3D of the root viewport. With no call, `Front` draws, since
; the first camera to enter claims a viewport with none (`camera_3d.cpp:189-191`). The golden calls
; `Side.make_current()` (`camera_3d.cpp:352-360`). `Top` is orthogonal, so a call to it swaps the
; projection too.
; No other golden calls a camera method, so no other scene shows a regression in the current camera.

